<title>USA: Wireless Telecom elects Dale Sydnor chairman.</title>
<headline>Wireless Telecom elects Dale Sydnor chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wireless Telecom Group Inc on Friday said Dale Sydnor, the company's president and chief executive, has been elected chairman of its board.</p>
<p>Gary Simonyan, the company's current chariman, will remain with the company as chairman emeritus.</p>
